+ 오늘을 넘기면 그마저도 소용없을지 모릅니다.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:10",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 11,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "대청 안이 조용해졌다.
+ 용왕님은 처방책을 바라보다가 천천히 눈을 감았다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:11",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 12,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "용왕",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "다른 약을 더 찾아보아라.
+ 남의 목숨을 빼앗아 내 목숨을 이으라는 처방을 어찌 따르겠느냐.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:12",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 13,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "의관",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "이미 할 수 있는 방법은 모두 써 보았습니다.
+ 지금은 선택할 시간이 거의 없습니다.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:13",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 14,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "용왕님의 손끝이 가늘게 떨렸다.
+ 대청 밖에서는 신하들이 낮은 목소리로 술렁이고 있었다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:14",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 15,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "용왕",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "자라야.
+ 네게 어려운 일을 하나 맡겨야겠다.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:15",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 16,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "right",
+           "speakerName": "주인공",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "R1",
+           },
+           "text": "말씀하십시오.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:16",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 17,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "용왕",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "육지로 올라가 토끼를 찾아 데려오너라.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:17",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 18,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "right",
+           "speakerName": "주인공",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "R1",
+           },
+           "text": "……전하.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:18",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 19,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "용왕",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "토끼에게 내 병에 대해서는 말하지 마라.
+ 간이 필요하다는 사실은 더더욱 알려서는 안 된다.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:19",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 20,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "용왕",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "그 사실을 알게 되는 순간 토끼는 틀림없이 달아날 것이다.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:20",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 21,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "용왕",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "용궁의 잔치라고 해도 좋다.
+ 병든 이를 도와달라고 해도 좋다.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:21",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 22,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "용왕",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "어떻게든 토끼를 이곳까지 데려오너라.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:22",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 23,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "나는 대답하지 못했다.
+ 무심코 목에 걸린 작은 패를 손으로 움켜쥐었다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:23",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 24,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "차가운 패의 감촉이 오래전 기억을 불러냈다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:24",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 25,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "어린 시절, 나는 큰비에 휩쓸려 민물에서 바다까지 떠내려왔다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:25",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 26,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "짠물이 목으로 밀려들었다.
+ 숨조차 제대로 쉴 수 없었다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:26",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 27,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "등껍질을 웅크린 나를 발견한 사람이 젊은 용왕님이었다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:27",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 28,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "용왕",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "겁먹지 마라.
+ 이것을 목에 걸어 보아라.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:28",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 29,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "용왕님은 작은 패를 내 목에 걸어 주었다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:29",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 30,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "자신의 비늘로 만들었다는 '바다의 숨결'이었다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:30",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 31,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "신기하게도 숨이 다시 트였다.
+ 그때부터 나는 바닷속에서도 편히 숨을 쉴 수 있었다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:31",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 32,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "주인공",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "네……
+ 조금 살 것 같습니다.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:32",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 33,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "용왕",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "그렇다면 천천히 말해 보아라.
+ 내 앞에서는 잘 보이려고 말을 꾸미지 않아도 된다.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:33",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+           "order": 34,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "left",
+           "speakerName": "용왕",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "L1",
+           },
+           "text": "네가 본 것을 있는 그대로 말해 주면 그것으로 충분하다.
+ 작은 목소리라도 내가 끝까지 듣겠다.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:34",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 35,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "눈을 뜨자 다시 어두운 용궁 대청이었다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:35",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 36,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "narration",
+           "speakerName": "해설",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+           },
+           "text": "그리고 바로 그 용왕님이 이제 내게 토끼를 속여 오라고 명하고 있었다.",
+           "type": "narration",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:36",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 37,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "right",
+           "speakerName": "주인공",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "rightActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+                 "key": "R1",
+               },
+             ],
+             "speakerActorKey": "R1",
+           },
+           "text": "전하께서는 제게 늘 사실대로 말하라고 하셨습니다.",
+           "type": "dialogue",
+         },
+         {
+           "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
+           "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
+           "directionNote": "",
+           "emotionNote": "",
+           "id": "review-main-002:start:37",
+           "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+           "order": 38,
+           "purposeNote": "",
+           "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
+           "speaker": "right",
+           "speakerName": "주인공",
+           "stageComposition": {
+             "leftActors": [
+               {
+                 "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
+                 "key": "L1",
+               },
+             ],
